      "finding_id": "sandero-ecog120-fuel-specific-injection",
      "status": "needs_review",
      "detail": "The Sandero page-5 table labels Eco-G 120 injection as one unqualified 'bezpośredni' value, while the Jogger page-6 table explicitly distinguishes petrol direct injection and LPG indirect injection. The two cenniks show matching Eco-G 120 labels, 1,199 cm3 displacement, 3/12 cylinders/valves and the same fuel-specific power figures, but the repository has no normalized Eco-G 120 engine record or model-engine relationship linking Sandero/Stepway and Jogger. Do not transfer or split the injection value until exact shared-powertrain identity is established.",
