    {
      "finding_id": "sandero-ecog120-lpg-total-versus-fillable-capacity",
      "status": "needs_review",
      "detail": "The Sandero cennik states LPG 40 l and petrol 50 l without identifying LPG total vessel capacity versus filling capacity. The Jogger cennik states LPG total/fillable capacity 50/40 l; the matching 40 l figure is consistent with the Jogger fillable value but is not sufficient evidence to classify the Sandero value by cross-model inference. Preserve the 18 existing generic fuel_tank_capacity observations and do not migrate them to lpg_vessel_capacity_total or lpg_vessel_filling_capacity.",
